{
  "name": "Phase 4B — Render Poll",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-1",
      "name": "Setup notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-680, -220],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "content": "## Catches up renders Phase 4 left pending\n\nPhase 4 requests a Creatomate render, waits 20s once, and checks status ONE\ntime. If Creatomate is still rendering at that point, the video is left at\n`videos.stage = 'render_requested'` with a Creatomate status-check URL\nparked in `render_url`. This workflow finds every video stuck there and\nchecks Creatomate again.\n\n## Before running this\n\n1. Needs the same **Creatomate account** (Header Auth) credential as Phase\n   4's Create Render / Check Render Status nodes, wired into this\n   workflow's own Check Render Status node, plus the **Supabase account**\n   credential on the two Supabase HTTP nodes.\n2. Two ways to run it: click 'Execute workflow' in the editor any time, or\n   activate the workflow to let the Schedule Trigger poll automatically\n   (every 10 minutes) — left INACTIVE by default so you decide when this\n   starts running unattended on the free Render.com instance.\n3. Per pending video: 'succeeded' -> `stage: 'rendered'` +real `render_url`\n   + `duration_seconds`. 'failed' -> `status: 'needs_human'` (stays at\n   `render_requested` so it's visible as stuck). Anything else (still\n   rendering/queued) -> left untouched for the next poll."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "trigger-manual",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-680, 260],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "trigger-schedule",
      "name": "Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [-680, 500],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            { "field": "minutes", "minutesInterval": 10 }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set-config",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-460, 380],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "1", "name": "supabase_url", "type": "string", "value": "https://bgzsdkzfakzwcvplfobq.supabase.co" }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "http-get-pending",
      "name": "Get Pending Renders",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [-240, 380],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $json.supabase_url }}/rest/v1/videos",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "supabaseApi",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "select", "value": "id,render_url,stage,status" },
            { "name": "stage", "value": "eq.render_requested" },
            { "name": "status", "value": "eq.in_progress" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "code-extract-render-id",
      "name": "Extract Render ID",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-20, 380],
      "parameters": {
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nreturn items.map(item => {\n  const video = item.json;\n  const parts = (video.render_url || '').split('/');\n  const renderId = parts[parts.length - 1];\n  if (!renderId) {\n    throw new Error(`Video ${video.id} is at stage 'render_requested' but its render_url (\"${video.render_url}\") has no parseable render id.`);\n  }\n  return { json: { video_id: video.id, render_id: renderId } };\n});"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "http-check-render",
      "name": "Check Render Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [200, 380],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "=https://api.creatomate.com/v2/renders/{{ $json.render_id }}",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "code-parse-result",
      "name": "Parse Render Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [420, 380],
      "parameters": {
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const row = $input.first().json;\nconst idx = $itemIndex;\nconst videoId = $('Extract Render ID').all()[idx].json.video_id;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  video_id: videoId,\n  render_id: row.id,\n  status: row.status,\n  succeeded: row.status === 'succeeded',\n  failed: row.status === 'failed',\n  render_url: row.status === 'succeeded' ? row.url : null,\n  duration_seconds: row.status === 'succeeded' && row.duration ? Math.round(row.duration) : null,\n  error_message: row.status === 'failed' ? (row.errorMessage || 'Creatomate reported status: failed') : null\n} }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "if-succeeded",
      "name": "Succeeded?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [640, 380],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-succeeded",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.succeeded }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "http-update-succeeded",
      "name": "Mark Rendered",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [860, 260],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.supabase_url }}/rest/v1/videos",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "supabaseApi",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "id", "value": "=eq.{{ $json.video_id }}" }
          ]
        },
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Prefer", "value": "return=representation" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { stage: 'rendered', render_url: $json.render_url, duration_seconds: $json.duration_seconds } }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "if-failed",
      "name": "Failed?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [860, 500],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-failed",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.failed }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "http-update-failed",
      "name": "Mark Needs Human",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1080, 420],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.supabase_url }}/rest/v1/videos",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "supabaseApi",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "id", "value": "=eq.{{ $json.video_id }}" }
          ]
        },
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Prefer", "value": "return=representation" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { status: 'needs_human' } }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "noop-still-processing",
      "name": "Still Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1080, 600],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "code-format-response",
      "name": "Format Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1300, 380],
      "parameters": {
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "return $input.all();"
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Manual Trigger": { "main": [[{ "node": "Config", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Schedule Trigger": { "main": [[{ "node": "Config", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Config": { "main": [[{ "node": "Get Pending Renders", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Get Pending Renders": { "main": [[{ "node": "Extract Render ID", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Extract Render ID": { "main": [[{ "node": "Check Render Status", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Check Render Status": { "main": [[{ "node": "Parse Render Result", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Parse Render Result": { "main": [[{ "node": "Succeeded?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Succeeded?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Mark Rendered", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Failed?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Failed?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Mark Needs Human", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Still Processing", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Mark Rendered": { "main": [[{ "node": "Format Response", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Mark Needs Human": { "main": [[{ "node": "Format Response", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Still Processing": { "main": [[{ "node": "Format Response", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] }
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "instanceId": "faceless-youtube-studio-phase4b"
  }
}
